<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53820" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατᾰγορ-εύω</span></b>  (aor. in use <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεῖπον</span>, hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταγορεύῃ</span> shd. be restored for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εύσῃ</span> in <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Pax</u>
			107
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tell, announce</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span> Ar.l.c.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερῶ</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> more freq. <i>denounce</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.54
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					3.3.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>accuse</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1314a22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be predicated</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ κατηγορίαι ὠνομάσθησαν ἀπὸ τοῦ
					-εύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dexipp.
					<u>in Cat.</u>
					6.27
				</span></i>
			.</div>
